@startuml
title Mission lifecycle (as enforced by PrismaMissionRepository)
hide empty description

[*] --> DRAFT : create()

DRAFT --> DRAFT : updateDraft()\n(new immutable route revision)
DRAFT --> PLANNED : plan()
PLANNED --> DISPATCHED : claim(droneId)\ndrone must match,\ndeadline not passed
DISPATCHED --> RUNNING : reportStatus(RUNNING)
RUNNING --> COMPLETED : reportStatus(COMPLETED)
DISPATCHED --> FAILED : reportStatus(FAILED)\nEXECUTION_FAILED | DATA_INVALID
RUNNING --> FAILED : reportStatus(FAILED)\nEXECUTION_FAILED | DATA_INVALID
PLANNED --> FAILED : sweepMissedDispatch()\nMISSED_DISPATCH (every 10 s)

DRAFT --> CANCELLED : cancel()
PLANNED --> CANCELLED : cancel()
DISPATCHED --> CANCELLED : cancel()
RUNNING --> CANCELLED : cancel()

FAILED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of FAILED
  derive() on a FAILED mission creates a NEW
  DRAFT mission (derivedFrom = failed id).
  The failed mission itself stays FAILED.
end note

note right of COMPLETED
  Only a COMPLETED mission accepts a result
  upload. Review/finalize are result-level
  operations and do NOT change MissionState.
end note
@enduml
